      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pervasive shame and feeling of invisibility you describe are incredibly heavy burdens, and your hesitation is completely valid when facing such deep-seated pain. While it feels like a dead end now, even the smallest act of continuing to breathe or seeking comfort is a form of resistance against that finality. Professional support can help you challenge the overwhelming narrative of being a complete failure and find a path toward feeling human again, one moment at a time.",
      "source": "target",
